  "prefLabel": "Plc 1104.04 Additional Documentation Required for Initial Licensure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1104.04 Additional Documentation Required for Initial Licensure. In addition to the documentation required by Plc 304.04, the applicant shall provide documentation of current certification by the applicable national certifying organization, as provided in Plc 1107.\n\nSource. #14444, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES: 1-26-36",
